# 🌸 Kora Cycle

**Understand your cycle. Understand yourself.**

Kora Cycle is a menstrual cycle tracking and women’s wellness platform designed to help young women better understand the physical and emotional changes that happen throughout their menstrual cycle.

Instead of focusing only on predicting the next period, Kora Cycle aims to help users understand their cycle as a whole — including **flow, symptoms, mood, energy, and feelings**.

## ✨ What Kora Cycle Does

Kora Cycle is designed to provide:

- 🩸 Menstrual cycle tracking
- 🌸 Cycle phase and "season" education
- 💭 Symptom and feeling awareness
- 📚 A women's health library
- 🧮 Cycle-related calculators
- 🤖 AI-powered questions and answers
- 👩‍⚕️ Future connections to clinicians and professional resources

## 🤖 AI Vision

One of the planned features of Kora Cycle is an AI-powered Q&A assistant that allows users to ask questions about their cycle, symptoms, flow, feelings, and general menstrual health.

The goal is to make cycle information easier to understand while helping users learn more about their own patterns.

