## 🚀 Project Status

The frontend version of Kora Cycle has been completed and deployed. Future development focuses on transforming the frontend into a full-stack application with persistent user data, backend services, and AI-powered cycle education and Q&A.

## 🎯 Vision

Kora Cycle aims to become more than a period tracker.

It is designed to help women understand the connection between their **cycle, body, emotions, and everyday experiences** — giving them information they can use to better understand themselves.

